// PLAN:
// - OpenConstrainedSpan (+1)
// - Loop: generate tokens with SafeSoftConstrainedStep (first 12) then SafeRepetitionPenaltyStep
// - Close ONLY when IsCompletePrefix AND length >= 8
// - If budget exhausted and still inside: use RollbackConstrainedToComplete then close
