// - "OCCOCCO" = 7 chars but 7 tokens in SMILES = diethylene glycol (valid chain extender)
// - "NCCCCN" = 6 chars = 1,4-butanediamine (valid chain extender)
// - "OCCCCCO" = 7 chars = 1,5-pentanediol (valid chain extender)
// - We want AT LEAST 4 heavy atoms between the functional groups
// - Minimum viable: "NCCN" (4), "OCCO" (4) - these are too short/might be exemplars
